{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>無綫年度盛事《萬千星輝賀台慶》紅地毯向來是女星爭妍鬥麗戰場，今年戴祖儀憑藉兩套風格迥異戰衣再度成為全場焦點。她 …</p><p></p>\n<p>無綫年度盛事《萬千星輝賀台慶》紅地毯向來是女星爭妍鬥麗戰場，今年戴祖儀憑藉兩套風格迥異戰衣再度成為全場焦點。她在錄影廠內換上深V內搭與周嘉洛及吳偉豪熱烈交談，卻意外引發一段惹人注目的台下插曲。男方一個不經意微傾身體與側目舉動，瞬間讓這幕畫面成為網絡瘋傳焦點。</p>\n<h2>今年戰衣細節滿分 透視跌膊兼大露背</h2>\n<p>從今年曝光的台慶造型可見，戴祖儀繼續沿用最能襯托白皙肌膚的銀色系晚裝，但設計上花足心思。她捨棄了去年的無肩帶款式，改以「跌膊一字肩」設計示人，並配搭閃鑽頸鏈及一頭黑長直髮，散發高貴女神氣場。戰衣最大亮點在於胸前採用薄紗透視剪裁，綴以精緻銀色閃石刺繡，令事業線在若隱若現間更添誘惑；轉身更暗藏玄機，大露背透視設計將其白滑美背與纖腰表露無遺，加上裙襬右腿高開衩剪裁，一雙修長美腿依然搶鏡。當晚她更與陳曉華及吳偉豪同框合照，三人站在一起相當養眼；而進入錄影廠後，她亦換上墨綠色西裝外套配搭白色內襯，與吳偉豪及周嘉洛有講有笑，在性感與型格之間切換自如。\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179549464312963414_7509269376b0512f39356e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"joeythyee_1795258442_4035241610417342019_354558212.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179549464312963414_7509269376b0512f39356e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>展現透視仙氣性感（圖片來源：IG@joeythyee）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17954946474122755_8314627616b0512f80ae44.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"joeythyee_1795258442_4035241617539282343_354558212.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17954946474122755_8314627616b0512f80ae44.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@joeythyee）\n<p></p></figcaption></figure>\n<h2>戴祖儀上屆台慶戰鬥格成經典</h2>\n<p>回顧上一屆台慶夜，戴祖儀以一身極具侵略性戰鬥格大晒冷，當時她身穿銀色閃片抹胸晚裝，超低胸心形剪裁令豐滿上圍一覽無遺。裙襬更採用大膽超高開衩設計，遊走於走光邊緣，當時與她一同出場郭柏妍亦坦言「怕凍」間接認輸。兩屆造型對比之下，她由去年極限火辣進化成今年高級神秘感，連續兩年穿著銀色閃片元素長裙亮相台慶。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179549465128684716_9844589326b0512fb94565.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"joeythyee_1763652332_3770111478641918285_354558212.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179549465128684716_9844589326b0512fb94565.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>上屆台慶戰鬥格成經典（圖片來源：IG@joeythyee）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>網民熱議台慶夜紅地毯大贏家</h2>\n<p>戴祖儀連續兩年精心挑選戰衣赴會並成功突圍，不少網民對於她今年兩套服裝切換給予高度評價。有人留言表示「今年套裙好有仙氣」、「換咗西裝入面件衫好惹火」，甚至有網民留意到台下吳偉豪舉動，笑指「連吳偉豪都忍唔住𥄫實」。網上輿論普遍認為她今年表現亮眼，穩坐大眾心中紅地毯大贏家位置，相關截圖及討論熱門程度持續高企。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179549465362139558_9187454676b0512fe1b4e7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"joeythyee_1795258442_4035241605468062538_354558212.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179549465362139558_9187454676b0512fe1b4e7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>今年造型都冇得輸！（圖片來源：IG@joeythyee）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179549465920783878_16234603096b051303af979.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"joeythyee_1795258442_4035241623092556073_354558212.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179549465920783878_16234603096b051303af979.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@joeythyee）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179549466215699428_16260170786b0513068fa0e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"joeythyee_1795258442_4035241619762202723_354558212.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179549466215699428_16260170786b0513068fa0e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@joeythyee）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179549466549077848_11871728196b051309ca4aa.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"joeythyee_1795258442_4035241625273602899_354558212.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179549466549077848_11871728196b051309ca4aa.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@joeythyee）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179549466874579214_18337045086b05130d26cb1.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"joeythyee_1763652332_3770111478910390366_354558212.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179549466874579214_18337045086b05130d26cb1.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>上年MVP（圖片來源：IG@joeythyee）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179549465128684716_9844589326b0512fb94565.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"joeythyee_1763652332_3770111478641918285_354558212.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179549465128684716_9844589326b0512fb94565.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@joeythyee）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%90%b3%e5%81%89%e8%b1%aa/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">吳偉豪</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%88%b4%e7%a5%96%e5%84%80/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">戴祖儀</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e8%90%ac%e5%8d%83%e6%98%9f%e8%bc%9d%e8%b3%80%e5%8f%b0%e6%85%b6/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">萬千星輝賀台慶</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3549092\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 24 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T06:04:09.711613+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1337,"images":9,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T04:31:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T05:57:22.663941+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T05:57:22.663941+00:00","content_hash":"4cc16074ee4fc3fd40039f10f35ac150681d00835641455292a1c72d28cd82a9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}